        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="toggle-note" id="toggle-note">
      <span class="l-en">Billed yearly — two months on us versus paying monthly.</span><span class="l-zh">按年结算——相比按月付费，等于免两个月。</span>
    </p>
  </header>

  {# ── TIER CARDS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  {%- set ck = '<span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"/></svg></span>' -%}
  <div class="cards">

    {# ---- FREE ---- #}
    <section class="card free" aria-label="Free plan">
      <div class="tname"><span class="dot"></span>{{ t('Free', '免费') }}</div>
      <p class="tfor">{{ t('A real taste of the desk — sample dashboards and one research report.', '桌面的真实体验——样板仪表盘与一份研究报告。') }}</p>
      <div class="price free-price">
        <span class="amt">{{ t('Free', '免费') }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="billed"><span class="l-en">Always free · sign in to save your watchlist.</span><span class="l-zh">永久免费 · 登录即可保存自选。</span></div>
      <div class="cta">
        <button class="gbtn gbtn-lg gbtn-pill" data-act="free" type="button">{{ t('Sign in — it’s free', '登录 — 完全免费') }}</button>
      </div>
